# roadmap Phase 6: dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/fast_boot.lua from a blank NVRAM (the first start).
# The game restores factory settings and waits for a button ("errors detected -- any button to
# continue"); the shortened wait does not change that, so no attract mode within 1000 frames.
# With "Error prompt: Continue" the game goes on by itself: attract mode starts at frame 12 on
# T.E. and SE, 11 on NBA JAM 1993, about 215 on the Wolf-unit games.
script dist/NBAJamRecomp/mods/fast_boot.lua
extra boot_probe.lua
game nbajamte nbajamse nbajam nbamht nbahangt
frames 1000
run errors=0
run errors=1
once fast boot: power-on wait shortened
errors=0: nolog attract at
errors=1: once fast boot: error prompt skipped
errors=1: once attract at
nbajamte: errors=1: once attract at 12
nbajamse: errors=1: once attract at 12
nbajam: errors=1: once attract at 11
